WEBVTT

00:17:28.329 --> 00:17:30.704
know earlier that I still believe,

00:17:30.996 --> 00:17:34.579
I feel very relieved to know that
because I was worried about you,

00:17:34.871 --> 00:17:36.954
given all you know about decision making,

00:17:37.079 --> 00:17:39.746
making important life choices
with a coin toss.